<title>GERMANY: DASA to work with Thomson CSF on radar project.</title>
<headline>DASA to work with Thomson CSF on radar project.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH, Germany 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Daimler-Benz Aerospace AG, the aircraft unit of Daimler-Benz AG, said on Monday it would cooperate with France's Thomson-CSF/Radars &amp; Contre- Mesures to build advanced radar devices.</p>
<p>DASA said the two companies would work on developing three-deminsional radar screens for military aircraft.</p>
<p>Their first project, DASA said, would be to equip Tornado fighter plans to fly more safely in bad weather and at night.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom + 49 69 756525.</p>
</text>
